{
 "name": "stage2-sky-ground-v2",
 "title": "F2 Stage 2 sky and ground (65560E82 girder strip, 6AE78470 ground page, 1/26 version)",
 "track": "w7-stage2",
 "status": "candidate",
 "state": "predicted-static; import only after live capture confirms the key (validate_predicted.py confirm + gate on the AQ-01/AQ-03 Stage 2 capture)",
 "created_at_utc": "2026-11-13T16:06:07.605366+00:00",
 "method": "W7-STAGE2 index masters: one CLUT-free master per 4bpp page, rendered through any CLUT.\n\nMaster (8 px/texel = the 2048 export grid; CPU only, deterministic, no AI, nothing added):\n  categorical layer  top-3 (label, weight u8) per pixel: for every native index i the one-hot mask is upsampled\n                     texel-centred (bilinear), gaussian-smoothed (sigma_cat texels) and raised to power_cat, then\n                     normalised (w7-stage7 build_s7 / w4-world catsoft method). It carries the class (alpha) of ANY\n                     CLUT: class = class of the strongest visible label where visible weight >= 0.5, else 0, so every\n                     CLUT gets its own native class map with smooth contours.\n  continuous layer   t (float16, NaN elsewhere) inside regions whose drawn CLUTs are monotone luminance ramps over the\n                     indices used there (palette-cycling lights, smoke and flame ramps): normalised convolution of the\n                     native index over the texels that are visible in that region (bilinear texel-centred upsample,\n                     gaussian sigma_t texels); render = lerp(P[floor t], P[ceil t]) (index_pipeline convention), t\n                     clamped to the CLUT's visible run.\nRender(CLUT) -> RGBA at 8 px/texel; the native class is then forced at every native texel centre floor((i+0.5)*s)\n(one pixel each, w6/w7 rule) and every export is re-read and validated (0 mismatches required).\nRegions come from the Stage 2 draw records (work/draws-s2.json): every drawn uv rect of every key of the page whose CLUT\nwords are known (static export CLUT or CRC-validated recovered phase).",
 "builder_doc": "W7-STAGE2 builder: Stage 2 art on exact-static TEX from the shared static export.\n\n    python -I build_s2.py <family> [freeze]      family = prep | sky | train | fx\n    -> staging/<name>/ (default) or frozen/<name>/ (freeze: immutable, refuses to overwrite)\n\nState of every key: predicted-static; import only after live capture confirms the key (validate_predicted.py confirm +\ngate on the AQ-01/AQ-03 Stage 2 capture).  Words come from static-extraction/stages/stage2/textures/<TEX>.words.bin\n(crc32 == TEX re-checked); CLUT words from the export's cluts.json or, for palette-cycling phases, from\nwork/recovered-cluts.json (CRC-validated marked CPU-VRAM snapshots of runs 153406/155355); crc32 == PAL re-checked.\nExports only for keys actually drawn in the Stage 2 window (work/draws-s2.json) whose CLUT words are known.\nMethod: s2master.py (CLUT-free index master; categorical + continuous layers; class forced and validated at every\nnative texel centre).  CPU only, deterministic; no generated imagery; nothing invented (no new text, colours or pixels\noutside the native index layout).  The Japanese mission-text page 9E88006F (1/40) is not touched.",
